# Cheap default

Named file + symptom → edit. Do not tour. Do not read `CLAUDE.md`, `CONTEXT.md`, or `build-wiring.mdc` for a known-file patch. Do not use the diagnose skill unless the user says diagnose.

## Explore (hard, per request)

User `@`/paths first. Else `python Tools/build_skill_index.py --skill Name` (file pack). Else one exact-symbol search.

Max: 2 Grep/Glob/CodeDrift search, 3 sliced Reads, 0 explore/generalPurpose agents. Stop when you can act. Ask one question if blocked. Never re-read a file already in this session.

## Replies

Keep paths, skill IDs, offsets, error strings, citations. Cut recap, tool narration, option lists, whole-file dumps. Caveman if the user says caveman.

## Done

After EngineHacks / Event Assembler / test changes: `.\MAKE_HACK_quick.cmd`, then `FE7_Hack.gba` is ready. Docs-only: skip. Do not create git branches unless asked.
